comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T16:47:02.100Z","harness:codex","text=Duplicate check: complete strict all-status3110-item corpus, refreshed open/in_progress lists and request-specific transaction-preview/managed-dependency search. Existing closed refusal/diagnostic owners and open managed-snapshot planning were read live and remain their own scopes. Reproduced during this delivery: three managed SDK dependency links cause read-only intake preview to refuse; normal committed bulk intake succeeds. Enhancement intake only, open and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-25T17:51:18.067Z","harness:codex","Intake/reconciliation provenance: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1592 carries this queued work and its source evidence. This item remains open and unclaimed; the PR implements the related SDK output batch and does not claim this queued scope completed."
  "2026-10-25T19:33:44.589Z","harness:codex","Implemented derived extension dependency exclusion before path inspection/copy/fingerprinting. Explicit schema and registered item storage retain precedence and still refuse non-regular authoritative entries; extension source/manifests/managed metadata remain authoritative. Receipt states derived_extension_dependencies_excluded. SDK and CLI/MCP regressions prove source settings, external sentinel, dependency link and item storage remain untouched. pm-changelog installed2026.10.25 equals current npm latest; generation/check will use that package without edits to its implementation."
  "2026-10-25T20:10:16.500Z","harness:codex",Both linked suites passed through pm test --run --progress. Managed dependency preview is exercised through public SDK and CLI/MCP; explicit schema/item paths inside those namespaces remain authoritative and refuse links. Full canonical static and exact coverage verification are being rerun after the transaction recovery corrections. No package implementation was copied into core.
  "2026-10-25T22:24:54.270Z","harness:codex","Acceptance verified: previews exclude only derived extension node_modules paths before stat, copying and fingerprinting. Explicit retained schema paths and registered item folders take precedence; authoritative symlinks continue to refuse with the existing typed error. Semantic CLI/MCP preview parity, unchanged source/link/sentinel controls, and direct Node/Bun public SDK preview controls pass. Canonical complete suite passes 11,423 tests with exact source coverage 100/100/100/100. SDK docs disclose derived-extension-dependency exclusion as an unresolved commit constraint."
  "2026-10-25T22:35:18.260Z","harness:codex","Continuation verification: unchanged SDK bundle SHA-256 c9121e06756c98f95884575f7bf6d1e925ecf75d27a9d69bd0f9c716258125f2 independently passes the public Node26.12.1 and Bun1.4.3 guarded-terminal, frozen-clock compensation and managed-preview controls. Fresh six-suite test run passes154 cases. Latest pm-changelog2026.10.25 generated both delivered entries under Unreleased and its check passes. Immutable original full-suite receipt confirms11423 passes and exact100/100/100/100. Defect-evidence gate has zero findings across452 governed terminal defects. Delivery remains one related PR with complete hosted review required."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T20:17:50.757Z","harness:codex","Classify derived dependency trees before stat, traversal, copying and fingerprinting. Explicit authoritative schema files and item folders take precedence over exclusions, so package usability never silently weakens tracker safety."
